{"detail": {"templateUuid": "0c6a8ce6ec02486d81258f7b3207463d", "projectUuid": "51f1add151224db198347d472f3f34bf", "name": "香草美人·屈原", "description": "在战国乱世的楚地，一段因“橘子”结缘的少年情谊，最终演变成了波澜壮阔又痛彻心扉的帝国挽歌。\n成年后的屈原与楚怀王熊槐曾立下“公如青山，我如松柏”的誓言，决意联手推行变法以图强国。然而，改革遭到了旧贵族的疯狂反扑，楚怀王在重压之下看似懦弱地背弃了盟约，将屈原罢官流放。多年后，楚国郢都沦陷，万念俱灰的屈原独立于汨罗江畔，发出“举世皆浊我独清”的悲叹，决意抱石殉国。\n短片《香草美人》以电影级的质感与极具诗意的情感反转，重塑了这段千古悲剧。正如片尾秦始皇的感叹：帝王的利剑只能开辟一时的疆土，而屈原的诗与傲骨，却能跨越两千年的岁月，长明万世！", "coverUrl": "/assets/4b5739d39ee52a3b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/81ab1376a763465f9834c715dbf068a7/7b94215189faa76f5fd441bbe8e8fab3ea5fc796.mp4", "snapshotId": 21806, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 8543130, "ownerUuid": "81ab1376a763465f9834c715dbf068a7", "avatar": "/assets/3baeab288a89a710.webp", "nickname": "者行孙AIGC", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 11, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1501, "code": "humanity_science", "tagLabel": "人文科普", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1501/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/OPa5MebgKAQ/", "createAt": "2026年06月25日 13:39", "updateAt": "2026年07月06日 16:31", "publishAt": "2026年07月06日 16:07", "playCount": 19, "viewCreationProcessCount": 9, "copyCanvasCount": 2, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/0c6a8ce6ec02486d81258f7b3207463d.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 240, "edges": 194}}, "recommendList": []}